  "2026-10-28T19:59:03.324Z",codex-agent,"Cause class: stale generated self-host snapshot after dependency-related changelog and tracker updates. The operational entry-point regression correctly rejects a bundle that differs from committed source. Current main merged with two parents. Keep the direct process audit and all coverage thresholds; stage only this repair, regenerate the tracked text bundle using self-host:write, then verify the committed artifact without repair."
  "2026-10-28T20:02:28.048Z",codex-agent,"The focused operational-entry-point test fails with the expected self-host tree mismatch on the merged Dependabot head. The repository AGENTS.md requires refreshing selfhost.bundle after tracker and generated documentation changes are staged. This tracked artifact is a text bundle. Regenerate only that snapshot, retain the independent committed-source verifier, and rerun the same direct CLI-process test after committing it. No production source or threshold change is needed."
